# Formalization of the Exchange of Letters amending the trade agreement.

```catala
declaration scope AmendmentDateScope:
  input original_agreement_date content date
  input amendment_duration content duration
  output effective_date content date
```

## Determining the effective date of the amended agreement.

```catala
scope AmendmentDateScope:
  date round down
  definition effective_date equals
    original_agreement_date + amendment_duration
```